    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942930/extras/c70aabc132702ec47c47dcd4b9280905.avif?t=1717151603\" width=600 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GamePlay</strong></h2>Enjoy the story while completing the puzzles.<br>Connect lines according to the numbers on the squares until all spaces are completed.<br>After completing the puzzle, you will get a diary of the protagonist's experience.<br>Collect all diaries to experience the complete story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></h2>You go to a library and you're doing a college research paper on fairy tales,<br>When you open the Little Red Riding Hood fairy tale book, you find that you have entered this fairy tale world.<br>But this fairy tale seems to be different from the original one.<br>What will happen there?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Red Riding Hood:</h2>The familiar Little Red Riding Hood, the one being chased by the Big Bad Wolf.<br>But here she has a curvy body and plump figure,<br>She is asking you for help.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942930/extras/43950b27c830652267021c01dfcd9d4b.avif?t=1717151603\" width=200 height=250 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinderella:</h2>The Cinderella who was once bullied is no longer the weak Cinderella.<br>What will she guide you to do if she becomes so proactive?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942930/extras/08b4b776c63d58192fe53fa31ab85cd3.avif?t=1717151603\" width=200 height=250 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sleeping Beauty:</h2>Sleeping Beauty, trapped in a sleep curse, is waiting for someone to help her break the curse.<br>And the way to break the curse is &quot;love&quot;.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942930/extras/7c0326c7037f8a338026a29cf0aab042.avif?t=1717151603\" width=200 height=250 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An imaginary fantasy erotic story with heroines who have unique personalities.<br></li><li>20 sexy erotic CGs of heroines.<br></li><li>Skip puzzles whenever you want. (Press Enter at puzzle).<br></li><li>CG appreciation mode. (Click the CG next to it after completing the puzzle)</li></ul>",
